# Sample custom Break-the-Targets layout for Mario (character 8).
# Reuses Mario's vanilla Target Test geometry (GrTMr.dat); only targets and
# platforms are custom. Coordinates are world/stage units (X right, Y up, Z depth).
# `platform <cx> <cy> <cz> <w> <d>`: top surface at cy, X extent w, Z depth d.
name Mario sample
character mario
target 0 30 0
target 45 60 0
target -45 60 0
platform -60 30 0 80 40
platform 60 30 0 80 40
